# Pairs with NewbornPinEventuallyUsable. The live advance is never wired in, as
# before #5572: a live leaf's read position moves only by replay, and production
# replays a live leaf only toward a bound the arming list names. Its own appends
# above those bounds are never covered, so its pin never becomes usable without a
# replay from -1.
MODULE: NewbornPinEventuallyUsableAdvanceNeverFires
TARGET: NewbornPinEventuallyUsable
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the live advance never fires
PERTURBS: LiveAdvance

--- FIND
    /\ mine[a] # {}
    /\ Armed(a)
--- REPLACE
    /\ mine[a] # {}
\* MUTATION: the live advance is never enabled.
    /\ FALSE
    /\ Armed(a)
--- END
